TITLE 1D transport, exchange; ask pe in cell 10 after 10 shifts

SOLUTION 0  Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -print_cells 10
    -punch_cells 10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false

USER_PUNCH
    -headings shift pe
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, -LA("e-")

END
